{"id":"h128","run":2,"role":"test_right","category":"simpleqa","question":"In what year did John Constable (English landscape painter) refuse the position of drawing master at Great Marlow Military College? Is the answer \"1802\"?","truth":"yes","model_answer":"yes","correct":true,"source":"OpenAI SimpleQA (openai/simple-evals, simple_qa_test_set.csv)","claims":[{"text":"Constable refused the Great Marlow Military College drawing master post in 1802.","confidence":0.65,"lean":1,"theta":1.021,"phi":0.0},{"text":"Standard biographical accounts place the Great Marlow offer in 1802.","confidence":0.6,"lean":1,"theta":0.9425,"phi":0.0},{"text":"1802 was when Constable was deciding between painting as a career and the family milling business.","confidence":0.65,"lean":1,"theta":1.021,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The offer was a secure teaching post that would have steered him away from full-time painting.","confidence":0.7,"lean":1,"theta":1.0996,"phi":0.0},{"text":"His refusal is usually presented as an early sign of his commitment to art.","confidence":0.65,"lean":1,"theta":1.021,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The writer cannot verify the year against a source.","confidence":0.9,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4137,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"Biographical details about Constable's early years are sometimes given with different dates, so an off-by-one error is possible.","confidence":0.5,"lean":-1,"theta":0.7854,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The context is consistent with 1802 but does not independently confirm it.","confidence":0.7,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.0996,"phi":0.0}],"relations":[{"i":0,"j":1,"J":0.9,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":2,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":4,"J":0.4,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":6,"J":-0.3,"relation":"contradicts"},{"i":0,"j":7,"J":0.5,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":2,"J":0.5,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":6,"J":-0.3,"relation":"contradicts"},{"i":1,"j":7,"J":0.5,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":4,"J":0.3,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":6,"J":-0.2,"relation":